; Everything it does happens somewhere other than where it is, which is this floor's subject stated by
; an enemy rather than by the ground. It never touches the player, so a region it is standing in is
; dangerous to be near and safe to be beside — a distinction the pads make it possible to act on.
;
; Difficulty two and a slightly heavier weight, both for the reason recorded on `memory_leech.tres`:
; at difficulty three it was absent from 24.2% of four hundred generated floors, which is worse than
; the Data Center's own worst case before that floor was corrected.
weight = 1.2
min_difficulty = 2
